WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:02.336
♪♪

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:03.170
[Claps]

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.047
That is one regal beagle.

00:00:05.214 --> 00:00:07.216
♪♪

00:00:09.301 --> 00:00:10.302
-Yeah
-Yay

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.555
If you were king you
would have a throne.

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:14.848
Woah!

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:19.102
I will not take this lying down!

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.230
[Train horn]

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:23.315
Who knew a dog could bring

00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:24.858
so many people together.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.026
[Gulps]

00:00:27.611 --> 00:00:28.737
Ready Snoopy?

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:30.781
[laughs]

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:34.034
Hey that's my blanket.

00:00:34.243 --> 00:00:35.577
Snoopy!

00:00:35.911 --> 00:00:37.412
♪♪

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:39.706
Snoopy catch a fish.

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:45.045
[Cheers]

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.048
You ought to try looking up at

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:50.384
the clouds, it's very relaxing.

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:57.349
I stand corrected.

00:00:57.349 --> 00:00:58.308
[Squeals]

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:01.395
How's it going Linus?

00:01:01.395 --> 00:01:03.188
I'm not missing the soft
comforting presence

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:04.398
of my blanket at all.

00:01:06.275 --> 00:01:08.485
Uhh, good for you.

00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:11.571
[laughs]

